{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Twisted SoV scalar product and its zero-twist limit — gl(3), L = 2, adjoint ⊗ adjoint\n\nCompanion to `SU3_Adjoint_SoV_ScalarProduct_L2.wb` (untwisted, 3×3). Goal: show that the untwisted 3×3 norm is a **minor** of the twisted 6×6 norm once the integrals of motion are chosen well, as was done for gl(4) (`untwisted-norm.md`, Part 3).\n\n**Setup.** Sites `[2,1,0] ⊗ [2,1,0]`, `θ_1 = 1/3`, `θ_2 = -8/57`, `h = 1`, unimodular twist `z_j = e^{φ_j}`, `φ_j = εψ_j`, `ψ = (1, 1/3, -4/3)`. Transfer matrices `T_a(u) = Σ_{|I|=a} z_I\\,\\mathrm{qmin}_{I,I}(u)`, with `T_3 = z_1z_2z_3\\,ν_1^{[-4]}ν_2^{[-2]}ν_3 = ν_1^{[-4]}ν_2^{[-2]}ν_3`.\n\n**Integrals of motion.** With twist, `T_1 = χ_1u^2 + s_1u + c_1` and `T_2 = χ_2u^4 + s_2u^3 + c_{22}u^2 + c_{21}u + c_{20}`. The leading coefficients are state-independent. That leaves **six** differences, in the basis\n\n$$w = \\big(\\underbrace{\\Delta c_1,\\ \\Delta c_{21},\\ \\Delta c_{20}}_{\\to\\ (\\Delta t_1,\\Delta t_{21},\\Delta t_{20})}\\ \\big|\\ \\underbrace{\\Delta c_{22}-\\Delta c_1,\\ \\Delta s_1,\\ \\Delta s_2}_{=\\,O(\\varphi)}\\big).$$\n\n**Identity.** `0 = ∑_{poles} E_2\\, Q^j_A[-ΔT_1ν_1^{[-2]} Q^B_i + ΔT_2 Q_i^{B[-2]}] = \\sum_c w_c\\,\\langle F_c\\rangle`, with the six column integrands\n\n`F_1 = Q^j(u^2 Q_i^{[-2]} - ν_1^{[-2]} Q_i)`, `F_2 = Q^j u Q_i^{[-2]}`, `F_3 = Q^j Q_i^{[-2]}`, `F_4 = Q^j u^2 Q_i^{[-2]}`, `F_5 = -Q^j u ν_1^{[-2]} Q_i`, `F_6 = Q^j u^3 Q_i^{[-2]}`.\n\nColumns 1–3 are exactly the untwisted matrix of the companion notebook. `E_2 = 1/∏_{α}∏_{n=0}^{3}(u-θ_α-nh)` has simple poles, so every integral is a finite weighted sum `Σ_p F(p)/∏_{p'≠p}(p-p')`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 0. gl(N) generators in the Gelfand-Tsetlin basis, ported verbatim from SU4_L1.wb (rank-independent). ---- *)\nClearAll[ps, dim, J0, Jp, Jm, JJ, v];\nps[rep_] :=\n    ps[rep] =\n    Block[\n        {res = (Prepend[rep, #]& /@ (Tuples[Table[Range[rep〚1, i + 1〛, rep〚1, i〛], {i, 1, Length[rep〚1〛] - 1}]]))},\n        If[Length[res〚1, 1〛] == 1, Reverse @ Sort @ res, Reverse @ Sort @ Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]\n    ];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat〚k, i〛, {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat〚k - 1, i〛, {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] :=\n    Jp[k][pat] =\n    -Sum[\n        Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k + 1, j〛 + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]\n        / Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k, j〛 + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} → pat〚k, i〛 + 1]],\n        {i, 1, k}\n    ];\nJm[k_][pat_] :=\n    Jm[k][pat] =\n    Sum[\n        Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k - 1, j〛 + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]\n        / Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k, j〛 + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} → pat〚k, i〛 - 1]],\n        {i, 1, k}\n    ];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] :=\n    JJ[k, l, rep] =\n    Which[\n        k == l,\n        DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n        l == k + 1,\n        Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}]〚i〛], v[#]]& /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n        l == k - 1,\n        Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}]〚i〛], v[#]]& /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n        l > k + 1,\n        JJ[k, k + 1, rep].JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep].JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n        l < k - 1,\n        JJ[k, k - 1, rep].JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep].JJ[k, k - 1, rep]\n    ];\nGrid[{{\"dim [2,1,0]\", dim[{2, 1, 0}]}}, Frame → All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"639556\" data-output-id=\"0\" data-out-n=\"8\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"38\" data-sub-end=\"38\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[8]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"38\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGV4dHtkaW0gWzIsMSwwXX0gJiA4XFxcaGxpbmVcZW5ke2FycmF5fQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:1.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim [2,1,0]</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:1.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:1.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
