  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. Transfer matrices with twist\n\nThe quantum minors `qmin_{I,I}(u)` are built once, exactly, at `θ_1 = 1/3, θ_2 = -8/57, h = 1`, and stored as `u`-coefficient matrices `qco[I,k]`. A twisted transfer matrix is then `Tco[a,k,z] = Σ_{|I|=a} z_I qco[I,k]`, for any `z` (exact or numeric).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 1. Two-site monodromy, quantum minors per index set, twisted transfer-matrix coefficients. ---- *)\nClearAll[rep, d1, id1, E1g, E2g, Etot, prm, Tm, qminM, subsetsA, qco, Tco, ν1, ν2, ν3, qdet, u, θ1, θ2, h];\nrep = {2, 1, 0};\nd1 = dim[rep];\nid1 = IdentityMatrix[d1];\nE1g[i_, j_] := E1g[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[JJ[i, j, rep], id1];\nE2g[i_, j_] := E2g[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[id1, JJ[i, j, rep]];\nEtot[i_, j_] := E1g[i, j] + E2g[i, j];\nprm = {θ1 → 1 / 3, θ2 → -8 / 57, h → 1};\n(* L_ij(u) = u δ_ij - h E_ji per site; T = L1(u-θ1) L2(u-θ2) *)\nTm[i_, j_][x_] :=\n    Sum[\n        ((x - θ1) KroneckerDelta[i, k] IdentityMatrix[64] - h E1g[k, i]).((x - θ2) KroneckerDelta[k, j] IdentityMatrix[64] - h E2g[j, k]) /. prm,\n        {k, 3}\n    ];\nqminM[II_] := Expand[Sum[Signature[σ] (Dot @@ Table[Tm[II〚σ〚k〛〛, II〚k〛][u - (k - 1)], {k, Length[II]}]), {σ, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}]];\nsubsetsA[a_] := Subsets[Range[3], {a}];\nDo[With[{m = qminM[II]}, Do[qco[II, k] = Coefficient[m, u, k], {k, 0, 2 Length[II]}]], {II, Join @@ (subsetsA /@ {1, 2, 3})}];\nTco[a_, k_, z_List] := Sum[(Times @@ z〚II〛) qco[II, k], {II, subsetsA[a]}];\nν1[x_] := (x - 1 / 3 - 2) (x + 8 / 57 - 2);\nν2[x_] := (x - 1 / 3 - 1) (x + 8 / 57 - 1);\nν3[x_] := (x - 1 / 3) (x + 8 / 57);\nqdet[x_] := ν1[x - 2] ν2[x - 1] ν3[x];\n(* checks with an exact generic unimodular twist *)\nWith[\n    {zt = {2, 3, 1 / 6}, zero = ConstantArray[0, {64, 64}]},\n    Grid[\n        {\n            {\n                \"[T_a(u), T_b(v)] = 0 (twisted, z = {2,3,1/6})\",\n                And @@ Flatten @ Table[Tco[a, k, zt].Tco[b, l, zt] - Tco[b, l, zt].Tco[a, k, zt] === zero, {a, 2}, {b, 2}, {k, 0, 2 a}, {l, 0, 2 b}]\n            },\n            {\"T_3 = z1 z2 z3 ν1[-4] ν2[-2] ν3\", Expand[Sum[Tco[3, k, zt] u^k, {k, 0, 6}] - qdet[u] IdentityMatrix[64]] === zero},\n            {\n                \"twisted T_a commute with Cartan, not with E_12\",\n                {\n                    And @@ Flatten @ Table[Tco[a, k, zt].Etot[i, i] - Etot[i, i].Tco[a, k, zt] === zero, {a, 2}, {k, 0, 2 a}, {i, 3}],\n                    Tco[1, 0, zt].Etot[1, 2] - Etot[1, 2].Tco[1, 0, zt] === zero\n                }\n            }\n        },\n        Frame → All,\n        Alignment → Left\n    ]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"639556\" data-output-id=\"1\" data-out-n=\"26\" data-sub-idx=\"20\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"3\" data-sub-start=\"24\" data-sub-end=\"44\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[26]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"38\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.64em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">[T_a(u), T_b(v)] = 0 (twisted, z = {2,3,1/6})</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T_3 = z1 z2 z3 </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">1[-4] </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">2[-2] </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">twisted T_a commute with Cartan, not with E_12</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[26]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{[T\\_a(u), T\\_b(v)] = 0 (twisted, z = \\{2,3,1/6\\})} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{T\\_3 = z1 z2 z3 $\\nu$1[-4] $\\nu$2[-2] $\\nu$3} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{twisted T\\_a commute with Cartan, not with E\\_12} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{False}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "17fe1666-2331-4fc9-974f-12ae4e4b64c9"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. Baxter operators for any twist; untwisted reference states\n\nWith `Q = z^u q` (direct) and `Q = y^u q`, `y = 1/z_j` (dual), the Baxter equations become polynomial:\n\n$$z\\,\\nu_1\\nu_1^{[-2]}\\nu_1^{[-4]}q^{[2]} - T_1\\nu_1^{[-2]}\\nu_1^{[-4]}q + z^{-1}T_2\\nu_1^{[-4]}q^{[-2]} - z^{-2}T_3q^{[-4]} = 0,$$\n$$\\nu_3^{[2]}\\nu_3^{[4]}\\nu_3^{[6]}g - y\\,T_1^{[2]}\\nu_3^{[4]}\\nu_3^{[6]}g^{[2]} + y^2T_2^{[4]}\\nu_3^{[6]}g^{[4]} - y^3T_3^{[6]}g^{[6]} = 0 .$$\n\nThe untwisted states (`z = y = 1`) are recomputed exactly as in the companion notebook: highest-weight vectors, staggering gauge, 3×3 matrix on the rows `\\mathcal T_a = \\{(1,1),(2,1),(2,2)\\}` over the full contour. The cell cross-checks the vacuum-normalised norms against the companion notebook (`1805/11748, 2800/2937, ±4085/5874, 1805/11748`).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 2. Baxter operators, untwisted reference states, and the six-column row functional. ---- *)\nClearAll[BaxOp, BaxOpD, wtOf, hwMus, hwBasis, polyKernel, qpoly, untw, poles, pw, rowInt, colFuns, rowU, TaRows, NhatU];\nBaxOp[T1_, T2_, z_][q_][x_] := z ν1[x] ν1[x - 1] ν1[x - 2] q[x + 1] - (T1 /. u -> x) ν1[x - 1] ν1[x - 2] q[x] + (T2 /. u -> x) ν1[x - 2] q[x - 1]/z - qdet[x] q[x - 2]/z^2;\nBaxOpD[T1_, T2_, y_][g_][x_] := ν3[x + 1] ν3[x + 2] ν3[x + 3] g[x] - y (T1 /. u -> x + 1) ν3[x + 2] ν3[x + 3] g[x + 1] + y^2 (T2 /. u -> x + 2) ν3[x + 3] g[x + 2] - y^3 qdet[x + 3] g[x + 3];\nqpoly[cl_List, y_] := cl . y^Range[0, Length[cl] - 1];\n(* polynomial kernel, degree <= 12, row-reduced from the top = staggering gauge (exact) *)\npolyKernel[op_] := Module[{c, x, pf, eqs, ns, rr},\n   pf = Function[y, Evaluate[Sum[c[m] y^m, {m, 0, 12}]]];\n   eqs = CoefficientList[Expand[op[pf][x]], x];\n   ns = NullSpace[Table[D[e, c[m]], {e, eqs}, {m, 0, 12}]];\n   rr = DeleteCases[RowReduce[Reverse /@ ns], {0 ..}];\n   SortBy[Table[Reverse[r] /. {a___, 0 ..} :> {a}, {r, rr}], Length]];\nwtOf = Transpose[Table[Diagonal[Etot[i, i]], {i, 3}]];\nhwMus = {{4, 2, 0}, {3, 3, 0}, {4, 1, 1}, {3, 2, 1}, {2, 2, 2}};\nhwBasis[w_] := Module[{idx = Flatten@Position[wtOf, w]}, Transpose@Table[ReplacePart[ConstantArray[0, 64], Thread[idx -> nv]], {nv, NullSpace[Join[Etot[1, 2], Etot[2, 3]][[All, idx]]]}]];\n(* untwisted states: q = direct (increasing degree), qd = duals ordered as q^1, q^2, q^3 (deg mu_j + 3 - j) *)\nuntw = Module[{recs},\n   recs = Flatten[Table[Module[{Bt = hwBasis[w], r, Rk, evs, ev, p},\n       r = First@Select[Subsets[Range[64], {Length[Bt[[1]]]}], Det[Bt[[#]]] =!= 0 &, 1];\n       Rk[a_, k_] := Inverse[Bt[[r]]] . (Tco[a, k, {1, 1, 1}] . Bt)[[r]];\n       evs = Eigenvectors[Rk[2, 0]];\n       Table[ev = evs[[c]]; p = First@Flatten@Position[Unitize[ev], 1];\n        <|\"mu\" -> w, \"T1\" -> Sum[(Rk[1, k] . ev)[[p]]/ev[[p]] u^k, {k, 0, 2}], \"T2\" -> Sum[(Rk[2, k] . ev)[[p]]/ev[[p]] u^k, {k, 0, 4}]|>, {c, Length[evs]}]], {w, hwMus}], 1];\n   recs = SortBy[recs, {First@Flatten@Position[hwMus, #[\"mu\"]] &, Coefficient[#[\"T2\"], u, 0] &}];\n   Table[Append[s, <|\"q\" -> polyKernel[BaxOp[s[\"T1\"], s[\"T2\"], 1]], \"qd\" -> Reverse[polyKernel[BaxOpD[s[\"T1\"], s[\"T2\"], 1]]]|>], {s, recs}]];\n(* E2 = 1/prod(u - p) over the 8 simple poles; integral = sum_p F(p)/prod_{p' != p}(p - p') *)\npoles = Flatten[Table[({1/3, -8/57}[[s]] + n), {s, 2}, {n, 0, 3}]];\npw = Table[1/Times @@ (p - DeleteCases[poles, p]), {p, poles}];\nrowInt[F_] := pw . (F /@ poles);\n(* the six column integrands for dual function Qa and direct function Qb *)\ncolFuns[Qa_, Qb_] := {Function[x, Qa[x] (x^2 Qb[x - 1] - ν1[x - 1] Qb[x])], Function[x, Qa[x] x Qb[x - 1]], Function[x, Qa[x] Qb[x - 1]], Function[x, Qa[x] x^2 Qb[x - 1]], Function[x, -Qa[x] x ν1[x - 1] Qb[x]], Function[x, Qa[x] x^3 Qb[x - 1]]};\nrowU[A_, B_, {i_, j_}] := rowInt /@ colFuns[Function[x, qpoly[A[\"qd\"][[j]], x]], Function[x, qpoly[B[\"q\"][[i]], x]]];\nTaRows = {{1, 1}, {2, 1}, {2, 2}};\nNhatU = Table[Det[rowU[s, s, #][[1 ;; 3]] & /@ TaRows], {s, untw}]/Det[rowU[untw[[1]], untw[[1]], #][[1 ;; 3]] & /@ TaRows];\nGrid[{{\"states (mu, deg q, deg q^j)\", Column[{#[\"mu\"], Length /@ #[\"q\"] - 1, Length /@ #[\"qd\"] - 1} & /@ untw]},\n  {\"all untwisted Baxter residuals vanish\", And @@ Flatten@Table[{Expand[BaxOp[s[\"T1\"], s[\"T2\"], 1][Function[y, Evaluate@qpoly[#, y]]][x]] === 0 & /@ s[\"q\"], Expand[BaxOpD[s[\"T1\"], s[\"T2\"], 1][Function[y, Evaluate@qpoly[#, y]]][x]] === 0 & /@ s[\"qd\"]}, {s, untw}]},\n  {\"N̂ (T_a, cols 1-3)\", NhatU}, {\"agrees with companion notebook\", NhatU === {1, 1805/11748, 2800/2937, 4085/5874, -4085/5874, 1805/11748}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
