       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[43]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{states (mu, deg q, deg q\\^{}j)} & \\begin{matrix}\\begin{pmatrix}4 & 2 & 0\\\\0 & 3 & 6\\\\6 & 3 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\begin{pmatrix}3 & 3 & 0\\\\1 & 2 & 6\\\\5 & 4 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\begin{pmatrix}4 & 1 & 1\\\\0 & 4 & 5\\\\6 & 2 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\begin{pmatrix}3 & 2 & 1\\\\1 & 3 & 5\\\\5 & 3 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\begin{pmatrix}3 & 2 & 1\\\\1 & 3 & 5\\\\5 & 3 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\begin{pmatrix}2 & 2 & 2\\\\2 & 3 & 4\\\\4 & 3 & 2\\end{pmatrix}\\end{matrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{all untwisted Baxter residuals vanish} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{N̂ (T\\_a, cols 1-3)} & \\left\\{1,\\frac{1805}{11748},\\frac{2800}{2937},\\frac{4085}{5874},-\\frac{4085}{5874},\\frac{1805}{11748}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{agrees with companion notebook} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "1f02f43a-4f95-4a0c-8cd5-e54e1ae4fcbb"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. Twisted states, Q-functions and regularised Q-functions\n\nFor each untwisted highest-weight state `U` and each `ε`, diagonalise a generic combination of the twisted `T_a`-coefficients inside the weight sector `μ_U`. Pick the eigenvector whose `T_1, T_2` are closest to those of `U` (numerics at 150 digits).\n\n- **Raw Q-functions:** `Q_k = z_k^u q_k` with `deg q_k = 4-μ_k`, and `Q^j = z_j^{-u} q^j` with `deg q^j = μ_j`, all monic, each from a linear least-squares solve of the Baxter equation.\n- **Regularised Q-functions:** `R_k ∈ span(Q_1..Q_k)` and `R^j ∈ span(Q^3..Q^j)`, fixed by agreeing with the untwisted `q_k`, `q^j` at `k` (resp. `4-j`) points. These are exact twisted solutions. The untwisted degrees are staggered, `deg = 4-μ_k+(k-1)` and `μ_j+3-j`, so the raw Q's cannot converge individually, but these combinations tend to the untwisted q's.\n\nChecks: Baxter residuals; the twisted identity `M^{AB}·w^{AB} = 0` for every ordered pair `A ≠ B` and every row type; `w_{4,5,6} = O(ε)`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 3. Twisted states at a given eps, Q-functions, regularisation, identity checks. ---- *)\nClearAll[prec, psi, rr, solveQ, twState, regFun, rawFun, rowT, wT, relRes, tw];\nprec = 150;\npsi = {1, 1 / 3, -4 / 3};\nrr = Association[Flatten[Table[{a, k} → (Prime[3 a + k + 2] / (10 + a + k)), {a, 2}, {k, 0, 2 a}], 1]];\n(* monic polynomial of degree d annihilated by op, least squares; returns {coefficients, residual relative to the operator scale} *)\nsolveQ[op_, d_] :=\n    Module[\n        {c, x, q, eqs, A, b, sol, sc},\n        q = Function[y, Evaluate[y^d + Sum[c[m] y^m, {m, 0, d - 1}]]];\n        eqs = CoefficientList[Expand[op[q][x]], x];\n        A = Table[Coefficient[e, c[m]], {e, eqs}, {m, 0, d - 1}];\n        b = eqs /. c[_] → 0;\n        sol = If[d == 0, {}, LeastSquares[A, -b]];\n        sc = Max[Abs[Flatten[{A, b, Expand[op[Function[y, y^(d + 1)]][x]] /. x → 1}]]];\n        {Append[sol, 1], Max[Abs[If[d == 0, b, A.sol + b]]] / sc}\n    ];\ntwState[U_, eps_] :=\n    Module[\n        {z = N[Exp[eps psi], prec], idx = Flatten @ Position[wtOf, U[\"mu\"]], K, vecs, lam, pick, v, T1, T2, qs, qds},\n        K = Sum[rr[{a, k}] Tco[a, k, z]〚idx, idx〛, {a, 2}, {k, 0, 2 a}];\n        vecs = Eigenvectors[K];\n        lam[vv_] :=\n            With[\n                {pp = First @ Ordering[-Abs[vv], 1]},\n                {Sum[(Tco[1, k, z]〚idx, idx〛.vv)〚pp〛 / vv〚pp〛 u^k, {k, 0, 2}], Sum[(Tco[2, k, z]〚idx, idx〛.vv)〚pp〛 / vv〚pp〛 u^k, {k, 0, 4}]}\n            ];\n        pick = First @ Ordering[Table[Total[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[#, u]& /@ (lam[vv] - {U[\"T1\"], U[\"T2\"]})]]], {vv, vecs}], 1];\n        v = vecs〚pick〛;\n        {T1, T2} = Expand /@ lam[v];\n        qs = Table[solveQ[BaxOp[T1, T2, z〚k〛], 4 - U[\"mu\"]〚k〛], {k, 3}];\n        qds = Table[solveQ[BaxOpD[T1, T2, 1 / z〚j〛], U[\"mu\"]〚j〛], {j, 3}];\n        <|\n            \"mu\" → U[\"mu\"],\n            \"eps\" → eps,\n            \"z\" → z,\n            \"T1\" → T1,\n            \"T2\" → T2,\n            \"eigRes\" → Max[Abs[Flatten[{Tco[1, 0, z]〚idx, idx〛.v - Coefficient[T1, u, 0] v, Tco[2, 1, z]〚idx, idx〛.v - Coefficient[T2, u, 1] v}]]],\n            \"q\" → qs〚All, 1〛,\n            \"qd\" → qds〚All, 1〛,\n            \"bRes\" → Max[Join[qs〚All, 2〛, qds〚All, 2〛]],\n            \"U\" → U\n        |>\n    ];\n(* raw and regularised Q-functions as Functions of x *)\nregFun[S_, \"direct\", k_] :=\n    Module[\n        {xp = {1 / 10, 7 / 20, 3 / 5}〚1;;k〛, Q, c},\n        Q[l_] := Function[x, S[\"z\"]〚l〛^x qpoly[S[\"q\"]〚l〛, x]];\n        c = LinearSolve[Table[Q[l][x], {x, xp}, {l, k}], Table[qpoly[S[\"U\"][\"q\"]〚k〛, x], {x, xp}]];\n        Function[x, Evaluate[Sum[c〚l〛 Q[l][x], {l, k}]]]\n    ];\nregFun[S_, \"dual\", j_] :=\n    Module[\n        {ls = Range[3, j, -1], xp, Q, c},\n        xp = {1 / 10, 7 / 20, 3 / 5}〚1;;Length[ls]〛;\n        Q[l_] := Function[x, S[\"z\"]〚l〛^(-x) qpoly[S[\"qd\"]〚l〛, x]];\n        c = LinearSolve[Table[Q[l][x], {x, xp}, {l, ls}], Table[qpoly[S[\"U\"][\"qd\"]〚j〛, x], {x, xp}]];\n        Function[x, Evaluate[c.Table[Q[l][x], {l, ls}]]]\n    ];\nrawFun[S_, \"direct\", k_] := Function[x, S[\"z\"]〚k〛^x qpoly[S[\"q\"]〚k〛, x]];\nrawFun[S_, \"dual\", j_] := Function[x, S[\"z\"]〚j〛^(-x) qpoly[S[\"qd\"]〚j〛, x]];\nrowT[A_, B_, {i_, j_}, mode_] := With[{f = If[mode === \"reg\", regFun, rawFun]}, rowInt /@ colFuns[f[A, \"dual\", j], f[B, \"direct\", i]]];\nwT[A_, B_] :=\n    With[\n        {d1 = CoefficientList[A[\"T1\"] - B[\"T1\"], u, 3], d2 = CoefficientList[A[\"T2\"] - B[\"T2\"], u, 5]},\n        {d1〚1〛, d2〚2〛, d2〚1〛, d2〚3〛 - d1〚1〛, d1〚2〛, d2〚4〛}\n    ];\nrelRes[row_, w_] := With[{den = Total[Abs[row w]]}, If[den < 10^ -100, 0, Abs[row.w] / den]];\ntw[eps_] := tw[eps] = twState[#, eps]& /@ untw;\nWith[\n    {S = tw[10^ -3], S4 = tw[10^ -4]},\n    Grid[\n        {\n            {\"max eigenvector residual\", N[Max[#[\"eigRes\"]& /@ S], 5]},\n            {\"max Baxter relative residual (direct + dual), degrees 4-μ_k and μ_j\", N[Max[#[\"bRes\"]& /@ S], 5]},\n            {\n                \"twisted T -> untwisted T: max coefficient distance at eps = 1e-3\",\n                N[Max[Table[Max[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[#, u]& /@ ({s[\"T1\"], s[\"T2\"]} - {s[\"U\"][\"T1\"], s[\"U\"][\"T2\"]})]]], {s, S}]], 5]\n            },\n            {\n                \"identity |M.w|/Σ|M_c w_c|, all A≠B, raw rows (all 9 (i,j)) and reg rows T_a: max\",\n                N[\n                    Max[\n                        Flatten\n                        @ Table[\n                            If[\n                                a == b,\n                                Nothing,\n                                Join[\n                                    Table[relRes[rowT[S〚a〛, S〚b〛, ij, \"raw\"], wT[S〚a〛, S〚b〛]], {ij, Tuples[Range[3], 2]}],\n                                    Table[relRes[rowT[S〚a〛, S〚b〛, ij, \"reg\"], wT[S〚a〛, S〚b〛]], {ij, TaRows}]\n                                ]\n                            ],\n                            {a, 6},\n                            {b, 6}\n                        ]\n                    ],\n                    5\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"max |w_4,5,6| / max |w_1,2,3| over cross pairs, eps = 1e-3 and 1e-4\",\n                N[\n                    Table[\n                        Max[Flatten @ Table[If[a == b, Nothing, Max[Abs[wT[SS〚a〛, SS〚b〛]〚4;;6〛]] / Max[Abs[wT[SS〚a〛, SS〚b〛]〚1;;3〛]]], {a, 6}, {b, 6}]],\n                        {SS, {S, S4}}\n                    ],\n                    5\n                ]\n            }\n        },\n        Frame → All,\n        Alignment → Left\n    ]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"639556\" data-output-id=\"3\" data-out-n=\"58\" data-sub-idx=\"17\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"7\" data-sub-start=\"71\" data-sub-end=\"116\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[58]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"38\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max eigenvector residual</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max Baxter relative residual (direct + dual), degrees 4-</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\">_k and </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\">_j</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">twisted T -&gt; untwisted T: max coefficient distance at eps = 1e-3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">identity |M.w|/Σ|M_c w_c|, all A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">B, raw rows (all 9 (i,j)) and reg rows T_a: max</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max |w_4,5,6| / max |w_1,2,3| over cross pairs, eps = 1e-3 and 1e-4</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">143</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">132</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.036204</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">118</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0.00095096</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.000095169</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[58]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{max eigenvector residual} & 0.\\times 10^{-143}\\\\\\hline\\text{max Baxter relative residual (direct + dual), degrees 4-$\\mu$\\_k and $\\mu$\\_j} & 0.\\times 10^{-132}\\\\\\hline\\text{twisted T -> untwisted T: max coefficient distance at eps = 1e-3} & 0.036204\\\\\\hline\\text{identity |M.w|/$\\Sigma$|M\\_c w\\_c|, all A$\\not=$B, raw rows (all 9 (i,j)) and reg rows T\\_a: max} & 0.\\times 10^{-118}\\\\\\hline\\text{max |w\\_4,5,6| / max |w\\_1,2,3| over cross pairs, eps = 1e-3 and 1e-4} & \\left\\{0.00095096,0.000095169\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "aa22140c-9781-48c8-a2d5-29f76ec9a28e"
