   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. Block structure of the 6×6 norm as ε → 0\n\nRows of the norm matrix `M_6^{AA}`:\n\n- **good rows** `G`: regularised `R^j, R_i` on `\\mathcal T_a = \\{(1,1),(2,1),(2,2)\\}`, full contour. Columns 1–3 of `G` tend to the untwisted 3×3 matrix;\n- **twist rows** `O`: three raw pairs `(i,j)`, full contour.\n\nWrite `M_6 = \\begin{pmatrix} A & B \\\\ C & D\\end{pmatrix}`, with `A = G_{1..3}` and `D = O_{4..6}`. Then `det M_6 = det A · det(D - C A^{-1} B)`. Block dominance means `det M_6 = det A·det D·(1+O(ε))`.\n\nThe cell measures:\n1. the ε-power of every raw-row entry, column by column;\n2. `det A / det N_{untw} - 1`;\n3. `|det M_6/(det A det D) - 1|` for all 84 triples of raw rows, at `ε = 10^{-4}, 10^{-5}`;\n4. the power of `det D` for the triples `i<j` and `i>j`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 4. Block structure: eps-profile, convergence of the minor, block dominance survey, powers of det D. ---- *)\nClearAll[rowsAt, slope, detU, goodA, blockRatio, surv, domTriples, detD, epsList, powTab];\nepsList = {10^ -3, 10^ -4, 10^ -5};\nrowsAt[eps_] :=\n    rowsAt[eps] =\n    Module[\n        {S = tw[eps]},\n        Association[Flatten[Table[{n, mode, ij} → rowT[S〚n〛, S〚n〛, ij, mode], {n, 6}, {mode, {\"raw\", \"reg\"}}, {ij, Tuples[Range[3], 2]}], 2]]\n    ];\nslope[n_, mode_, ij_] :=\n    MapThread[If[Abs[#2] < 10^ -90, \"0\", Round[N[Log[10, Abs[#1] / Abs[#2]]]]]&, {rowsAt[10^ -4][{n, mode, ij}], rowsAt[10^ -5][{n, mode, ij}]}];\ndetU = Table[Det[rowU[s, s, #]〚1;;3〛& /@ TaRows], {s, untw}];\ngoodA[eps_, n_] := rowsAt[eps][{n, \"reg\", #}]& /@ TaRows;\nblockRatio[eps_, n_, tr_] :=\n    Module[\n        {G = goodA[eps, n], O = rowsAt[eps][{n, \"raw\", #}]& /@ tr, dD},\n        dD = Det[O〚All, 4;;6〛];\n        If[Abs[dD] < 10^ -100, Indeterminate, Det[Join[G, O]] / (Det[G〚All, 1;;3〛] dD)]\n    ];\nsurv = Table[{tr, Table[Abs[blockRatio[e, n, tr] - 1], {e, {10^ -4, 10^ -5}}, {n, 6}]}, {tr, Subsets[Tuples[Range[3], 2], {3}]}];\ndomTriples = Select[surv, FreeQ[#〚2〛, Indeterminate] && Max[#〚2, 2〛] < 10^ -3 && Max[#〚2, 2〛] < Max[#〚2, 1〛] / 5&]〚All, 1〛;\ndetD[eps_, n_, tr_] := Det[(rowsAt[eps][{n, \"raw\", #}]& /@ tr)〚All, 4;;6〛];\npowTab =\n    Table[\n        {\n            untw〚n, \"mu\"〛,\n            Total[Table[untw〚n, \"mu\", i〛 - untw〚n, \"mu\", j〛, {i, 3}, {j, i + 1, 3}], 2],\n            Round[Log[10, Abs[detD[10^ -4, n, {{1, 2}, {1, 3}, {2, 3}}] / detD[10^ -5, n, {{1, 2}, {1, 3}, {2, 3}}]]]],\n            Round[Log[10, Abs[detD[10^ -4, n, {{2, 1}, {3, 1}, {3, 2}}] / detD[10^ -5, n, {{2, 1}, {3, 1}, {3, 2}}]]]],\n            N[Abs[blockRatio[10^ -5, n, {{1, 2}, {1, 3}, {2, 3}}] - 1], 3],\n            N[Abs[blockRatio[10^ -5, n, {{2, 1}, {3, 1}, {3, 2}}] - 1], 3]\n        },\n        {n, 6}\n    ];\nColumn[\n    {\n        Grid[\n            Prepend[\n                Table[{ij, slope[1, \"raw\", ij]}, {ij, Tuples[Range[3], 2]}],\n                {\"raw row (i,j), vacuum\", \"ε-power in columns 1..6 (\\\"0\\\" = identically zero)\"}\n            ],\n            Frame → All\n        ],\n        Grid[\n            Prepend[\n                Table[{e, Sequence @@ N[Table[Det[goodA[e, n]〚All, 1;;3〛] / detU〚n〛 - 1, {n, 6}], 3]}, {e, epsList}],\n                Prepend[untw〚All, \"mu\"〛, \"ε \\\\ det A/det N_untw - 1\"]\n            ],\n            Frame → All\n        ],\n        Grid[\n            {\n                {\"triples of raw rows with block dominance for all 6 states (of 84)\", Length[domTriples]},\n                {\"failing triples\", Complement[surv〚All, 1〛, domTriples]}\n            },\n            Frame → All,\n            Alignment → Left\n        ],\n        Grid[\n            Prepend[\n                powTab,\n                {\n                    \"mu\",\n                    \"Σ_{i<j}(μ_i-μ_j)\",\n                    \"power of det D, rows i<j\",\n                    \"power of det D, rows i>j\",\n                    \"|det M6/(det A det D) - 1|, i<j, ε=1e-5\",\n                    \"same, i>j\"\n                }\n            ],\n            Frame → All\n        ]\n    }\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"639556\" data-output-id=\"4\" data-out-n=\"70\" data-sub-idx=\"12\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"9\" data-sub-start=\"34\" data-sub-end=\"73\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[70]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"38\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"wolfbook-render-error\" style=\"color:#cc0000;font-family:monospace;white-space:pre-wrap\">[LaTeX error] KaTeX parse error: Undefined control sequence: \\0 at position 115: … columns 1..6 (\\̲0̲\\ = identically…<br><small>\\begin{matrix}\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{raw row (i,j), vacuum} &amp; \\text{$\\varepsilon$-power in columns 1..6 (\\0\\ = identically zero)}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,1\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{\\text{0},\\text{0},\\text{0},\\text{0},0,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,2\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{4,4,5,3,2,2\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,3\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{6,6,7,5,4,4\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,1\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{0,0,1,-1,-2,-2\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,2\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{\\text{0},\\text{0},\\text{0},\\text{0},0,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,3\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{4,4,5,3,2,2\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,1\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{-2,-2,-1,-3,-4,-4\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,2\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{0,0,1,-1,-2,-2\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,3\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{\\text{0},\\text{0},\\text{0},\\text{0},0,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{$\\varepsilon$ \\\\ det A/det N\\_untw - 1} &amp; \\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{3,3,0\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{4,1,1\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{3,2,1\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{3,2,1\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{2,2,2\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\frac{1}{1000} &amp; 0.0254 &amp; 0.00435 &amp; -0.00496 &amp; -0.0930 &amp; -0.0529 &amp; -0.00231\\\\\\hline\\frac{1}{10000} &amp; 0.00248 &amp; 0.000436 &amp; -0.000497 &amp; -0.00929 &amp; -0.00538 &amp; -0.000228\\\\\\hline\\frac{1}{100000} &amp; 0.000247 &amp; 0.0000436 &amp; -0.0000498 &amp; -0.000928 &amp; -0.000539 &amp; -0.0000228\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{triples of raw rows with block dominance for all 6 states (of 84)} &amp; 76\\\\\\hline\\text{failing triples} &amp; \\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{1,1\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{1,2\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{1,3\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{1,1\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{1,2\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{2,3\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{1,1\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{2,1\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{3,1\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{1,1\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{2,2\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{3,3\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{1,2\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{2,2\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{3,2\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{1,3\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{2,3\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{3,3\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{2,1\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{2,2\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{2,3\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{3,1\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{3,2\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{3,3\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{mu} &amp; \\text{$\\Sigma$\\_\\{i&lt;j\\}($\\mu$\\_i-$\\mu$\\_j)} &amp; \\text{power of det D, rows i&lt;j} &amp; \\text{power of det D, rows i&gt;j} &amp; \\text{|det M6/(det A det D) - 1|, i&lt;j, $\\varepsilon$=1e-5} &amp; \\text{same, i&gt;j}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\} &amp; 8 &amp; 10 &amp; -6 &amp; 0.0000284 &amp; 5.20\\times 10^{-6}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,3,0\\right\\} &amp; 6 &amp; 8 &amp; -4 &amp; 0.0000634 &amp; 0.0000502\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,1,1\\right\\} &amp; 6 &amp; 8 &amp; -4 &amp; 0.0000841 &amp; 0.0000610\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,2,1\\right\\} &amp; 4 &amp; 6 &amp; -2 &amp; 0.0000381 &amp; 0.0000169\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,2,1\\right\\} &amp; 4 &amp; 6 &amp; -2 &amp; 0.0000428 &amp; 0.0000140\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,2,2\\right\\} &amp; 0 &amp; 2 &amp; 2 &amp; 0.000225 &amp; 0.000205\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\end{matrix}</small></span></div></div></div>",
