      {
       "data": "Out[70]= \\begin{matrix}\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{raw row (i,j), vacuum} & \\text{$\\varepsilon$-power in columns 1..6 (\\0\\ = identically zero)}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\text{0},\\text{0},\\text{0},\\text{0},0,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,4,5,3,2,2\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,3\\right\\} & \\left\\{6,6,7,5,4,4\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,0,1,-1,-2,-2\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\text{0},\\text{0},\\text{0},\\text{0},0,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,3\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,4,5,3,2,2\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{-2,-2,-1,-3,-4,-4\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,0,1,-1,-2,-2\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,3\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\text{0},\\text{0},\\text{0},\\text{0},0,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{$\\varepsilon$ \\\\ det A/det N\\_untw - 1} & \\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,3,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,2,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,2,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,2,2\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\frac{1}{1000} & 0.0254 & 0.00435 & -0.00496 & -0.0930 & -0.0529 & -0.00231\\\\\\hline\\frac{1}{10000} & 0.00248 & 0.000436 & -0.000497 & -0.00929 & -0.00538 & -0.000228\\\\\\hline\\frac{1}{100000} & 0.000247 & 0.0000436 & -0.00004… [latex truncated: 2604 chars total]",
