      {
       "data": "Out[84]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{rewriting E2 -> M, arbitrary $\\Delta$T, all 9 raw (i,j), all 6 states, eps=1e-3: max rel. diff} & 0.\\times 10^{-125}\\\\\\hline\\text{identity <G>.w' = 0, all A$\\not=$B, 9 raw + 3 reg rows: max |row.w'|/$\\Sigma$|row\\_c w'\\_c|} & 0.\\times 10^{-118}\\\\\\hline\\text{O($\\varphi$) directions ($\\Delta$s1, a1+a2, b1+b2-6a1-$\\Delta$c1) / max|w'|, eps = 1e-3, 1e-4} & \\left\\{0.0069969,0.00069997\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{det M6[M-rows] / det M6[E2-rows], rows T\\_a + raw i<j, per state, eps=1e-4} & \\left\\{-78.980609,-78.980609,-78.980609,-78.980609,-78.980609,-78.980609\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{same, raw i>j} & \\left\\{-78.980609,-78.980609,-78.980609,-78.980609,-78.980609,-78.980609\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{untwisted N̂ from H-columns over M} & \\left\\{1,\\frac{1805}{11748},\\frac{2800}{2937},\\frac{4085}{5874},-\\frac{4085}{5874},\\frac{1805}{11748}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{equals N̂ of the E2 form} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "42e519ca-bf07-48b4-90bd-b82eca287cf4"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Results of section 6** (150 digits).\n- The rewriting `E_2 → M` holds term by term for arbitrary `ΔT_1` (deg 1), `ΔT_2` (deg 3), all 9 raw `(i,j)`, all 6 states: relative difference `~10^{-125}`.\n- Identity `⟨G⟩_M·w' = 0` for all 30 cross pairs, 9 raw + 3 regularised rows: `~10^{-118}`.\n- The three `O(φ)` directions `(Δs_1, a_1+a_2, b_1+b_2-6a_1-Δc_1)` are `0.0070, 0.00070` of `max|w'|` at `ε = 10^{-3}, 10^{-4}`.\n- `det M_6[M] / det M_6[E_2] = -28512/361 ≈ -78.98`, the same for all 6 states and both triples `i<j`, `i>j`: the change of measure is a constant change of basis in the space of integrals of motion, so all earlier block-structure statements carry over.\n- Untwisted: the 3×3 built from `H = (G_2+G_6, G_3-G_5+6G_6, G_4-G_6)` over `M` gives exactly `N̂ = {1, 1805/11748, 2800/2937, ±4085/5874, 1805/11748}`, identical to the `E_2` form.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Γ[(u-θ-h)]/Γ[u-θ+h] = 1/(u-θ)/(u-θ-h)",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
